      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
      "acceptance_id": "AC2",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 3,
      "summary": "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/kernel/enrollment.ts:324 的 overload 将包含 optional checkpoint 的 EnrollmentEntryRequest 声明为始终返回 EnrollCanaryResult，但实现会返回 cancelled 或 enrolled outcome。合法的接口类型调用因此无法可靠处理取消：TypeScript 允许访问 result.record，实际返回 cancelled 时会抛出 TypeError。将返回普通结果的 overload 限定为 checkpoint 缺失或 undefined，并为一般 EnrollmentEntryRequest 提供准确的联合返回类型；补充接口类型请求的类型与取消行为覆盖。",
      "anchor": "sha256:9b68a250df510371c58228ee6bf93e212845215dce24d691c119d7439279f582",
      "evidence": {
        "trigger": "使用有效 binding 和 now 构造 const request: EnrollmentEntryRequest = { binding, now, checkpoint: () => false }，在 ready rehearsal 状态调用 enrollTask(root, registry, request)。该请求匹配返回 EnrollCanaryResult 的第二个 overload，因此 result.record.task_id 能通过类型检查；实际执行到第 367 行返回 { outcome: \"cancelled\" }，record 为 undefined，访问 task_id 抛出 TypeError。checkpoint 返回 true 时同样返回包装 outcome，而不是所声明的普通结果。",
        "caller_chain": [
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/kernel/enrollment.ts:EnrollmentEntryRequest",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/kernel/enrollment.ts:enrollTask overloads",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/kernel/enrollment.ts:enrollTask checkpoint return"
        ],
        "violated": {
